schema: public-use-boundary
object:
  tier: public-with-caveat
  consent_note: >-
    Claims about Silvi Protocol's tree-verification pipeline and automated
    payment mechanism are drawn from a single promotional playbook
    (src/content/docs/silvi-protocol.md, sources: [] in frontmatter). Treat
    verification-accuracy and "provable impact" claims as unverified
    marketing language until corroborated against Silvi's own technical
    documentation or an independent audit. No named individuals or specific
    planting locations were captured; this boundary is about the
    MRV/ecological-claim content, not personal data.
  review_type: domain-review (MRV/ecological-claims + third-party protocol accuracy)
